sequenceDiagram

    participant ClientA as Sender Client
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Chat as Chat Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant NATS as NATS Event Bus
    participant RT as Realtime Service
    participant ClientB as Receiver Client

    ClientA->>Gateway: Send Message
    Gateway->>Chat: Forward Request

    Chat->>DB: Store Message
    DB-->>Chat: Success

    Chat->>NATS: Emit chat.message.created

    NATS->>RT: Deliver Event

    RT->>ClientB: WebSocket Push